OL,3,GNEWSACall to expand archive with young
OL,4,Aphotographers
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new exhibition exploring how a city
OL,7,Fhas changed over time has coincided
OL,8,Fwith an open call for young
OL,9,Fphotographers.
OL,11,FUnder Development: What Happens When
OL,12,FCities Change? has opened at Newcastle
OL,13,FContemporary Art gallery, featuring
OL,14,Fimages which span more than 50 years
OL,15,Ffrom the AmberSide Collection.
OL,17,FRunning alongside the exhibition,
OL,18,Fsubmissions have opened for Newcastle
OL,19,FNow, which has asked photographers
OL,20,Funder 25 to capture their changing
OL,21,Fsurroundings.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
